{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"一、元年，春王正月，公即位。公子遂如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"繼弒君不言即位，此其言即位何？其意也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"二、三月，遂以夫人婦姜至自齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"遂何以不稱公子？一事而再見者，卒名也。夫人何以不稱姜氏？貶。曷為貶？譏喪娶也。喪娶者公也，則曷為貶夫人？內無貶于公之道也。內無貶于公之道，則曷為貶夫人？夫人與公一體也。其稱婦何？有姑之辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"三、夏，季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"四、晉放其大夫胥甲父于衞。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"放之者何？猶曰無去是云爾。然則何言爾？近正也。此其為近正奈何？古者大夫已去，三年待放。君放之，非也；大夫待放，正也。古者臣有大喪，則君三年不呼其門。已練可以弁冕，服金革之事。君使之非也，臣行之禮也。閔子要絰而服事，既而曰：「若此乎古之道，不即人心。」退而致仕。孔子蓋善之也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"五、公會齊侯于平州。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"六、公子遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"七、六月，齊人取濟西田。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"外取邑不書，此何以書？所以賂齊也。曷為賂齊？為弒子赤之賂也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"八、秋，邾婁子來朝。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"九、楚子、鄭人侵陳，遂侵宋。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"十、晉趙盾帥師救陳。宋公、陳侯、衞侯、曹伯會晉師于斐林伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"此晉趙盾之師也，曷為不言趙盾之師？君不會大夫之辭也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"十一、冬，晉趙穿帥師侵柳。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"柳者何？天子之邑也。曷為不繫乎周？不與伐天子也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cdt_115_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_115","textTraditional":"十二、晉人、宋人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}